  "title": "Getting started",
  "nodes": {
    "n_7f990d6829e0ab73": {
      "id": "n_7f990d6829e0ab73",
      "title": "This map",
      "summary": "Drag me. Double-click the background to add a node.",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "b_f42ea1cef78e2b66",
          "type": "markdown",
          "value": "Everything here is an ordinary node. Delete it all when you are done reading.\n\n- **Link two nodes** by dragging the dot on a card's right edge onto another card.\n- **Add a child** with `Tab` while a node is selected.\n- **Find anything** with `Ctrl`+`K`.",
          "label": ""
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "reference"
      ],
      "status": null,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "fields": {},
      "color": null,
      "created": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.210Z",
      "updated": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.210Z"
    },
    "n_f6ecba70e813c709": {
      "id": "n_f6ecba70e813c709",
      "title": "Quick capture",
      "summary": "Ctrl+K, type a name, Shift+Enter.",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "b_51694479b5e30eb5",
          "type": "markdown",
          "value": "If the quick switcher finds nothing, Enter creates a node with what you typed.\n\nA thought you cannot file in five seconds is a thought you will not file.",
          "label": ""
        }
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "status": null,
      "x": -300,
      "y": 160,
      "fields": {},
      "color": null,
      "created": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.210Z",
      "updated": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.210Z"
    },
    "n_3b3cabf0e2215023": {
      "id": "n_3b3cabf0e2215023",
      "title": "Filtering",
      "summary": "Labels, status, focus, and compound queries.",
      "content": [
        {
          "id": "b_b317c4afa61a592e",
          "type": "markdown",
          "value": "Label chips cycle **neutral → require → exclude**, so hiding everything tagged\n`work` is two clicks.\n\nFocus does the relationship filters: everything within N links of a node,\neverything under it, everything above it, or its whole cluster.\n\nThe Query section stacks conditions with AND/OR and a per-row NOT, and drops\nto raw JSON when you need nesting.",
          "label": ""
        }
      ],
      "tags": [
        "reference"
      ],
      "status": null,
      "x": 0,
      "y": 200,
      "fields": {},
      "color": null,
      "created": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.211Z",
      "updated": "2026-09-16T00:45:05.211Z"
    },
